      { name: '状态', icons: ['SuccessFilled', 'InfoFilled', 'WarningFilled', 'QuestionFilled', 'CircleCheck', 'Failed', 'Select', 'Check', 'Close', 'Remove', 'Hide'] },
      { name: '其他', icons: ['Star', 'ThumbUp', 'Lightning', 'Download', 'Upload', 'List', 'Code', 'Connection', 'Tree', 'Picture', 'Promotion', 'Discount', 'Shop', 'Present', 'Phone', 'Wallet', 'Coin', 'Coffee', 'Headset', 'Help'] },
    ];

    function makeIconSvg(iconName) {
      var path = iconPathMap[iconName];
      if (!path) return '';
      return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">' + path + '</svg>';
    }

    function getIconSvg(name) {
      if (!name) return '';
      var n = name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + name.slice(1);
      return makeIconSvg(n) || makeIconSvg(name);
    }

    // ===== 递归扁平化树 =====
    function flattenTree(nodes, level, parentId, result) {
      if (!nodes) return result;
      nodes.forEach(function (node) {
        var item = Object.assign({}, node);
        item._level = level;
        item._parentId = parentId;
        result.push(item);
        if (node.children && node.children.length > 0) {
          flattenTree(node.children, level + 1, node.id, result);
        }
      });
      return result;
    }

    function isRowVisible(item) {
      var pid = item._parentId;
      while (pid !== undefined && pid !== null && pid !== 0) {
        if (!expandedIds[String(pid)]) return false;
        pid = findParentId(pid);
      }
      return true;
    }
    function findParentId(id) {
      for (var i = 0; i < flatList.length; i++) {
        if (String(flatList[i].id) === String(id)) return flatList[i]._parentId;
      }
      return null;
    }
    function hasChildren(node) {
      return node.children && node.children.length > 0;
    }

    // ===== 构建上级菜单下拉选项 =====
    function buildParentOptions(selectedId) {
      var html = '<option value="">顶级菜单</option>';
      flatList.forEach(function (item) {
        if (item.type === 'BUTTON') return;
        var indent = '';
        for (var i = 0; i < item._level; i++) indent += '\u3000';
        var selected = (selectedId !== undefined && String(item.id) === String(selectedId)) ? ' selected' : '';
        html += '<option value="' + Admin.esc(item.id) + '"' + selected + '>' + indent + Admin.esc(item.title) + '</option>';
      });
      return html;
    }

    // ===== 渲染树形表格 =====
    function renderTreeTable() {
      var keyword = searchKeyword.trim().toLowerCase();
      var visibleRows;
      if (keyword) {
        visibleRows = flatList.filter(function (item) {
          return (item.title || '').toLowerCase().indexOf(keyword) >= 0;
        });
        if (visibleRows.length === 0) {
          tableContainer.innerHTML = '<div class="admin-empty"><p>未找到匹配「' + Admin.esc(searchKeyword.trim()) + '」的菜单</p></div>';
          return;
        }
      } else {
        visibleRows = flatList.filter(isRowVisible);
        if (visibleRows.length === 0) {
          tableContainer.innerHTML = '<div class="admin-empty"><p>暂无菜单数据</p></div>';
          return;
        }
      }
      var html = '<div class="admin-table-wrap"><div class="admin-table-scroll"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr>';
      html += '<th>菜单名称</th><th style="width:60px;text-align:center;">图标</th><th>路由地址</th><th>组件路径</th><th style="width:70px;text-align:center;">类型</th><th style="width:60px;text-align:center;">排序</th><th style="width:80px;text-align:center;">状态</th><th style="width:200px;text-align:center;">操作</th>';
      html += '</tr></thead><tbody>';
      visibleRows.forEach(function (row) {
        var indent = '';
        for (var i = 0; i < row._level; i++) {
          indent += '<span style="display:inline-block;width:24px;"></span>';
        }
        var expanded = !!expandedIds[String(row.id)];
        var canExpand = hasChildren(row);
        var toggleHtml = (canExpand && !keyword)
          ? '<span class="menu-tree-toggle' + (expanded ? ' expanded' : '') + '" data-toggle="' + Admin.esc(row.id) + '"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg></span>'
          : '<span class="menu-tree-toggle leaf"></span>';
        html += '<tr data-id="' + Admin.esc(row.id) + '">';
        html += '<td>' + indent + toggleHtml + '<span style="font-weight:600;">' + Admin.esc(row.title) + '</span></td>';
        html += '<td style="text-align:center;"><span class="menu-icon-cell">' + (getIconSvg(row.icon) || '<span style="color:var(--text-tertiary);">-</span>') + '</span></td>';
        html += '<td><code style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">' + Admin.esc(row.path || '-') + '</code></td>';
        html += '<td><code style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-tertiary);">' + Admin.esc(row.component || '-') + '</code></td>';
        html += '<td style="text-align:center;">' + Admin.badge(typeMap[row.type] || '未知', typeBadgeMap[row.type] || 'default') + '</td>';
        html += '<td style="text-align:center;">' + Admin.esc(row.sort != null ? row.sort : '-') + '</td>';
        html += '<td style="text-align:center;">' + (row.hidden == 0 ? Admin.badge('显示', 'success') : Admin.badge('隐藏', 'danger')) + '</td>';
        html += '<td class="col-actions" style="text-align:center;">';
        if (row.type !== 'BUTTON') {
          html += Admin.actBtn('新增', 'act-success', null, row.id);
        }
        html += Admin.actBtn('修改', 'act-edit', null, row.id);
        html += Admin.actBtn('删除', 'act-del', null, row.id);
        html += '</td>';
        html += '</tr>';
      });
      html += '</tbody></table></div></div>';
      tableContainer.innerHTML = html;

      tableContainer.querySelectorAll('[data-toggle]').forEach(function (toggle) {
        toggle.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
          e.stopPropagation();
          var id = toggle.getAttribute('data-toggle');
          if (expandedIds[String(id)]) {
            delete expandedIds[String(id)];
          } else {
            expandedIds[String(id)] = true;
          }
          renderTreeTable();
        });
      });
    }

    // ===== 加载菜单树 =====
    function loadTree() {
      Admin.showLoading(tableContainer);
      Admin.api.get('/sys/menu/tree').then(function (data) {
        treeData = Array.isArray(data) ? data : (data && data.records) || (data && data.list) || [];
        flatList = flattenTree(treeData, 0, null, []);
        renderTreeTable();
      }).catch(function (err) {
        Admin.showError(tableContainer, err.message);
      });
    }

    // ===== 图标选择器 =====
    function buildIconPicker(selectedIcon) {
      var html = '<div class="icon-picker">';
      html += '<div class="icon-picker-search">';
      html += '<input type="text" class="glass-input icon-picker-search-input" placeholder="搜索图标..." />';
      html += '</div>';
      html += '<div class="icon-picker-grid">';
      iconCategories.forEach(function (cat) {
        html += '<div class="icon-picker-cat">';
        html += '<div class="icon-picker-cat-name">' + Admin.esc(cat.name) + '</div>';
        html += '<div class="icon-picker-cat-icons">';
        cat.icons.forEach(function (iconName) {
          var isSelected = (selectedIcon && selectedIcon === iconName) ? ' selected' : '';
          html += '<div class="icon-picker-item' + isSelected + '" data-icon="' + Admin.esc(iconName) + '" title="' + Admin.esc(iconName) + '">';
          html += makeIconSvg(iconName);
          html += '<span class="icon-picker-item-label">' + Admin.esc(iconName) + '</span>';
          html += '</div>';
        });
        html += '</div></div>';
      });
      html += '</div></div>';
      return html;
    }

    // ===== 新增/编辑弹窗 =====
    function openMenuModal(row, parentId) {
      var isEdit = !!row;
      var currentIcon = isEdit ? (row.icon || '') : '';

      var body =
        '<form id="edit-form">' +
          '<div class="admin-form-row">' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>上级菜单</label>' +
              '<select class="glass-input" name="parentId" data-type="number" id="parent-select"></select>' +
            '</div>' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>菜单类型 <span class="req">*</span></label>' +
              '<select class="glass-input" name="type">' +
                '<option value="CATALOG">目录</option>' +
                '<option value="MENU">菜单</option>' +
                '<option value="BUTTON">按钮</option>' +
              '</select>' +
            '</div>' +
          '</div>' +
          '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
            '<label>菜单名称 <span class="req">*</span></label>' +
            '<input type="text" class="glass-input" name="title" placeholder="请输入菜单名称" required />' +
          '</div>' +
          '<div class="admin-form-row">' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>路由路径</label>' +
              '<input type="text" class="glass-input" name="path" placeholder="如 /admin/user" />' +
            '</div>' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>组件路径</label>' +
              '<input type="text" class="glass-input" name="component" placeholder="如 admin/user/index" />' +
            '</div>' +
          '</div>' +
          '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
            '<label>图标</label>' +
            '<div id="icon-picker-container">' +
              buildIconPicker(currentIcon) +
            '</div>' +
            '<input type="hidden" name="icon" id="icon-hidden" value="' + Admin.esc(currentIcon) + '" />' +
          '</div>' +
          '<div class="admin-form-row">' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>排序</label>' +
              '<input type="number" class="glass-input" name="sort" data-type="number" placeholder="数字越小越靠前" value="0" />' +
            '</div>' +
            '<div class="admin-form-group">' +
              '<label>是否显示</label>' +
              '<select class="glass-input" name="hidden" data-type="number">' +
                '<option value="0">显示</option>' +
                '<option value="1">隐藏</option>' +
              '</select>' +
            '</div>' +
          '</div>' +
        '</form>';

      var footer =
        '<button class="glass-btn glass-btn-ghost glass-btn-sm" data-modal-close>取消</button>' +
        '<button class="glass-btn glass-btn-primary glass-btn-sm" id="btn-save">保存</button>';

      Admin.openModal({
        title: isEdit ? '编辑菜单' : '新增菜单',
        body: body,
        footer: footer,
        width: '700px',
        onOpen: function (modal) {
          var form = modal.querySelector('#edit-form');
          var parentSelect = modal.querySelector('#parent-select');
          var iconHidden = modal.querySelector('#icon-hidden');

          // 填充上级菜单选项
          var pid = isEdit ? row.parentId : (parentId !== undefined ? parentId : '');
          parentSelect.innerHTML = buildParentOptions(pid);

          if (isEdit) {
            Admin.fillForm(form, row);
            iconHidden.value = row.icon || '';
          }

          // 图标选择器事件
          var pickerContainer = modal.querySelector('#icon-picker-container');
          var iconItems = pickerContainer.querySelectorAll('.icon-picker-item');
          iconItems.forEach(function (item) {
            item.addEventListener('click', function () {
              iconItems.forEach(function (i) { i.classList.remove('selected'); });
              item.classList.add('selected');
              var iconName = item.getAttribute('data-icon');
              iconHidden.value = iconName;
            });
          });

          // 图标搜索
          var searchInput = pickerContainer.querySelector('.icon-picker-search-input');
          if (searchInput) {
            searchInput.addEventListener('input', function () {
              var kw = searchInput.value.trim().toLowerCase();
              iconItems.forEach(function (item) {
                var name = (item.getAttribute('data-icon') || '').toLowerCase();
                item.style.display = kw === '' || name.indexOf(kw) >= 0 ? '' : 'none';
              });
            });
          }

          modal.querySelector('#btn-save').addEventListener('click', function () {
            var data = Admin.serializeForm(form);
            data.icon = iconHidden.value;
            if (!data.title) { Admin.toast('请输入菜单名称', 'error'); return; }

            var promise;
            if (isEdit) {
              data.id = row.id;
              promise = Admin.api.put('/sys/menu/', data);
            } else {
              promise = Admin.api.post('/sys/menu', data);
            }
            promise.then(function () {
              Admin.toast(isEdit ? '修改成功' : '新增成功', 'success');
              Admin.closeModal();
              loadTree();
            }).catch(function (err) {
              Admin.toast(err.message || '保存失败', 'error');
            });
          });
        },
      });
    }

    // ===== 删除 =====
    function handleDelete(id) {
      Admin.confirm('确定要删除该菜单吗？子菜单也将一并删除。', function () {
        Admin.api.del('/sys/menu/' + id).then(function () {
          Admin.toast('删除成功', 'success');
          loadTree();
        }).catch(function (err) {
          Admin.toast(err.message || '删除失败', 'error');
        });
      });
    }

    // ===== 根据 ID 查找节点 =====
    function findNodeById(id) {
      for (var i = 0; i < flatList.length; i++) {
        if (String(flatList[i].id) === String(id)) return flatList[i];
      }
      return null;
    }

    // ===== 事件绑定 =====
    document.getElementById('btn-add').addEventListener('click', function () {
      openMenuModal(null);
    });
    document.getElementById('btn-refresh').addEventListener('click', loadTree);

    var searchTimer = null;
    if (searchInput) {
      searchInput.addEventListener('input', function () {
        if (searchTimer) clearTimeout(searchTimer);
        searchTimer = setTimeout(function () {
          searchKeyword = searchInput.value;
          renderTreeTable();
        }, 200);
      });
    }

    tableContainer.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var btn = e.target.closest('button[data-id]');
      if (!btn) return;
      var id = btn.getAttribute('data-id');
      if (btn.classList.contains('act-del')) {
        handleDelete(id);
      } else if (btn.classList.contains('act-success')) {
        openMenuModal(null, id);
      } else if (btn.classList.contains('act-edit')) {
        var node = findNodeById(id);
        if (node) openMenuModal(node);
      }
    });

    // ===== 初始化 =====
    loadTree();
    }
  })();
</script>

